            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>0.1.4</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Echo cancellation is now automatically skipped when you're recording with headphones connected. Previously, playback volume dipped and Bluetooth headphones (like AirPods) dropped to mono call-quality audio while recording. Now headphones stay at full quality.</li>
                    <li>The Echo cancellation toggle in Settings still works as a master override.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
