        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 12 May 2026 15:43:14 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>0.1.0 - First Sparkle release</h2>
                <p>Auto-updates are now wired up. Future versions will install in-place
                via the standard "Check for Updates..." menu item.</p>
                <h3>Headline features</h3>
                <ul>
                  <li>Live recording pill with audio meter + meeting title</li>
                  <li>Floating transcript HUD + in-meeting notes editor</li>
                  <li>Notes-aware summarisation (Qwen3 14B by default)</li>
                  <li>Persistent speaker identity (voice embeddings)</li>
                  <li>Per-meeting and per-app audio capture scopes</li>
                  <li>Calendar-driven title + participant auto-fill</li>
                  <li>System notifications for pre-meeting, app-launch, and idle</li>
                  <li>Vocabulary terms + replacement rules</li>
                  <li>Rename + delete meetings from the library</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure
                url="https://github.com/darylthornhill/meetingnotetaker/releases/download/v0.1.0/MeetingNoteTaker-0.1.0.zip"
